sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant To as Timeout
    participant Rt as Retry with jitter
    participant Bh as Bulkhead
    participant CB as Circuit breaker
    participant S as Service
    C->>To: request with a deadline
    To->>Bh: within its own resource pool
    Note over Bh: one slow dependency cannot consume every thread
    Bh->>CB: is this dependency healthy?
    alt closed
        CB->>Rt: allow
        Rt->>S: attempt, bounded and jittered
        S-->>C: response
    else open
        CB-->>C: shed immediately
        Note over CB: failing fast is kinder than queuing forever
    end
    Note over To,S: a deadline that is not propagated downstream is not a deadline
